					"nextDialogs": [
						741180402
					],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180402,
					"content": "看靠近櫃檯的桌旁，面前放著一個帽子的那個男人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180403
					],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180403,
					"content": "我很確定，他在前幾天剛剛尾隨過我們。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180404,
						741180405
					],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180404,
					"content": "我去叫警官。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180406
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741180406,
					"content": "報警是個不錯的選擇…旁邊正好有一位警官。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180407
					],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180407,
					"content": "我們之前就向這位梅莘警官報過案，她也清楚我們如今的處境。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180408
					],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180408,
					"content": "我相信她會願意幫助我們的。有一位警官在旁邊，那群人應該也不敢做出什麼太超過的舉動。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180409
					],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180409,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}，請您去向梅莘警官說明情況，我去找加爾恰先生。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180410
					],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180410,
					"content": "嗯，快點出發吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180405,
					"content": "直接報警吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180406
					]
				}
