			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 741180601,
					"content": "…謝謝您，梅莘警官。您一過來，那個傢伙就起身離開了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180602
					],
					"speakerTitle": "加爾恰"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180602,
					"content": "沒什麼，只是我分內的事。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180603
					],
					"speakerTitle": "梅莘"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180603,
					"content": "先生，看來我們還是必須迅速離開這裡，回到佩特莉可鎮。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180604
					],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180604,
					"content": "我認為那群傢伙已經逐漸失去耐心了，說不定…會做出什麼過激的舉動。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180605
					],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180605,
					"content": "我過一會就將此事上報，過幾天就會有結果。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180606
					],
					"speakerTitle": "梅莘"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180606,
					"content": "最好的情況是我們可以派遣幾名同事護送你們。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180607
					],
					"speakerTitle": "梅莘"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180607,
					"content": "但我們的人手有限，還要顧及城裡的事務，只能護送你們一段路，不能直接送到佩特莉可鎮…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180608
					],
					"speakerTitle": "梅莘"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180608,
					"content": "而且在那之前，你們最好要搬到一個安全的地方住，關於此事的討論可能會持續…一段時間。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180609,
						741180610
					],
					"speakerTitle": "梅莘"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180609,
					"content": "護送就交給我了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180611
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741180611,
					"content": "感謝您。有您同行，那群人一定更加不敢亂來了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180612
					],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180612,
					"content": "但迦雅小姐不是在劇團工作嗎？你們去佩特莉可鎮，那她…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180613
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180613,
					"content": "唔…我會和他們一起去的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180614
					],
					"speakerTitle": "迦雅"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180614,
					"content": "什麼？！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180615
					],
					"speakerTitle": "加爾恰"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180615,
					"content": "小姐，我發自內心地請求您。請務必…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180616
					],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180616,
					"content": "親愛的路通，不要試圖說服我。我和你的老板一樣，無法被他人說服。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180617
					],
					"speakerTitle": "迦雅"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180617,
					"content": "但、但我們都不知道會遇見什麼危險…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180618
					],
					"speakerTitle": "加爾恰"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180618,
					"content": "那我更應該和你們一起走了。難道你想讓我和上次一樣，拿著一篇沒頭沒尾的樂譜離開嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180619
					],
					"speakerTitle": "迦雅"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180619,
					"content": "況且我們劇團的團長對這種「算」出來的樂譜也很有興趣。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180620
					],
					"speakerTitle": "迦雅"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180620,
					"content": "我相信他應該也很支持我和你們同行…好，我說完了，接下來我們要去哪裡？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180621
					],
					"speakerTitle": "迦雅"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180621,
					"content": "和、和在須彌一樣，迦雅小姐在氣勢上完全把加爾恰先生給制伏了呢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180622
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180622,
					"content": "加爾恰永遠贏不了了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180623
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741180623,
					"content": "也有可能是加爾恰先生壓根就沒有想要贏…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180624
					],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180624,
					"content": "咳！路通，我們要快點去找個適合的地方住了！最好是人多一點的地方。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180625
					],
					"speakerTitle": "加爾恰"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180625,
					"content": "人多的地方…我們也許可以去…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180626
					],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180626,
					"content": "不如，去我們劇團在住的旅館？那裡有很多人，而且大家彼此都認識。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180627
					],
					"speakerTitle": "迦雅"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180627,
					"content": "如果有陌生人想要混進來馬上就會被發現。而且，我們團長一定也很想瞭解計數器。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180628
					],
					"speakerTitle": "迦雅"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180628,
					"content": "呃…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180629
					],
					"speakerTitle": "加爾恰"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180629,
					"content": "就這麼辦！太棒了，一切問題都得到了解決。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180630
					],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180630,
					"content": "一切問題？！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180631
					],
					"speakerTitle": "加爾恰"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180631,
					"content": "#那就這麼定了。{NICKNAME}，這些錢請您收下，就當做是預付的護送費吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180632
					],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180632,
					"content": "雖然不知道什麼時候才能出發…但到時候，就萬事拜託您了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180633
					],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180633,
					"content": "但我怎麼覺得現在的問題越來越多了啊？！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "加爾恰"
				},
				{
					"id": 741180610,
					"content": "我可以護送你們。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741180611
					]
				}
