					"nextDialogs": [
						741185007
					],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 741185007,
					"content": "希望加爾恰先生能夠說服迦雅小姐迅速離開楓丹。這樣的話，我們還可以依照原計畫行事。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 741185008,
					"content": "加爾恰的研究不是沒前景了嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741185009
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741185009,
					"content": "這個「沒前景」是指無法再進一步提升效能。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741185010
					],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 741185010,
					"content": "但在應用領域，這臺「計數器」可是大有可為。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741185011
					],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 741185011,
					"content": "只不過，加爾恰先生從來都不怎麼在意應用領域的事…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741185012
					],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 741185012,
					"content": "我想這也是他經常陷入痛苦的原因之一。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741185013
					],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 741185013,
					"content": "不過也正因如此，他將一位失意研究者的形象扮演得非常出色。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 741185014,
					"content": "再見。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741185015
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741185015,
					"content": "那就拜託您了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
